   "summary": "Diagram 'Checkout' (id: checkout, sequence diagram)\nLifelines (left to right):\n  - [kunde] Kunde «actor»\n  - [shop] Shop : WebApp\n  - [zahlung] Zahlung : PaymentService\n  - [bestellung] Bestellung : Order\n  - [orders] Order Service (= element order-service)\nFragments (top to bottom):\n  - [m1] kunde -> shop: checkout(warenkorb) (synchCall)\n  - [m2] shop -> shop: validieren() (synchCall)\n  - [cf1] alt covering kunde, shop, zahlung, bestellung\n    operand [op1] [Zahlung ok]:\n      - [m3] shop -> zahlung: bezahlen(betrag) (synchCall)\n      - [m4] zahlung -> shop: bestätigt (reply)\n      - [m5] shop -> bestellung: anlegen (createMessage)\n    operand [op2] [else]:\n      - [m6] shop -> kunde: Fehler anzeigen (asynchSignal)\n  - [cf2] loop covering shop, bestellung\n    operand [op3] [für jede Position]:\n      - [m7] shop -> bestellung: position(artikel) (asynchCall)\n  - [ref1] ref Versand beauftragen covering shop, bestellung\n  - [m8] shop -> kunde: Bestellbestätigung (reply)\n  - [m9] (found) -> shop: Sitzung abgelaufen (asynchSignal, found)\n  - [m10] shop -> (lost): Audit-Ereignis (asynchSignal, lost)\n  - [m11] shop -> bestellung: verwerfen (deleteMessage)\nExecution specifications:\n  - [ex1] on shop from m1 to m8\n  - [ex2] on zahlung from m3 to m4",
